<Layout title="Amazon Fulfillment Optimization">

<p class="eyebrow">
Case Study
</p>

<h1>
Amazon Fulfillment Network Optimization
</h1>

<p class="lead">
Optimizing throughput across high-volume fulfillment operations while improving cost, speed, and customer experience.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>Business Problem</h2>

<p>

High-volume fulfillment centers experienced operational bottlenecks affecting throughput, labor utilization, and customer delivery performance.

</p>

<h2>My Role</h2>

<p>

Led cross-functional initiatives across Operations, Engineering, Supply Chain, and Technology teams to identify constraints and deliver scalable improvements.

</p>

<h2>Approach</h2>

<ul>

<li>Mapped operational workflows</li>

<li>Identified bottlenecks</li>

<li>Prioritized high-impact initiatives</li>

<li>Partnered with technical teams</li>

<li>Measured outcomes using operational KPIs</li>

</ul>

<h2>Business Impact</h2>

<div class="impact">

<div>

<h3>$12M+</h3>

<p>Estimated annual operational value</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>20%</h3>

<p>Improved throughput</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Multi-site</h3>

<p>Operational deployment</p>

</div>

</div>

</Layout>

<style>

.lead{

font-size:1.2rem;

max-width:800px;

color:#6B7280;

}

.impact{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);

gap:2rem;

margin-top:2rem;

}

.impact div{

padding:2rem;

border:1px solid #E5E7EB;

border-radius:12px;

text-align:center;

}

@media(max-width:900px){

.impact{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

}

</style>